From: Shengyu Qu <wiagn233@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: riscv: adapt upstream kernel memory fixup

Apply upstream 43177705ab29's memory handoff fix to D1.
The original commit changes VisionFive2's board hook, which D1 does not use.
Use D1's detected DRAM base and size in its existing board hook.

Upstream-reference: 43177705ab29ed1ccca970096de1ef3c6095e7e6

--- a/board/sunxi/board-riscv.c
+++ b/board/sunxi/board-riscv.c
@@ -602,6 +602,11 @@
 {
 	int __maybe_unused r;
 
+	/* Pass detected DRAM to the kernel DTB, as upstream VisionFive2 does. */
+	r = fdt_fixup_memory(blob, gd->ram_base, gd->ram_size);
+	if (r)
+		return r;
+
 	/*
 	 * Call setup_environment and fdt_fixup_ethernet again
 	 * in case the boot fdt has ethernet aliases the u-boot
